en with GSD. Biochemical investigations revealed that ALT 2 time above upper limit normal, hypertriglyceridemia and hyperuricemia were the most frequent among children with GSD.", "abstract_snippet": "The literature has shown that GSD tyope-1 is the most common GSD while GSD type - III is known to be the second most frequent GSD globally.", "has_full_abstract": true, "main_abstract_source": "publisher_page", "gs_use_publisher_full_abstract": false, "title_refetch_main_abstract_source": "bibtex", "abstract_supplemented_by_title_query": true}}

